# Superseded figures. Kept on disk so their look and their generators stay
# available for reference, but deliberately untracked: nothing here is a build
# input, and none of it is referenced by main.tex.
#
# Ignore everything in this folder except this file, so the rule survives a
# fresh clone.
#
# It applies to NEW files only. Twenty figures here (fig_common_fragment_metric,
# fig_comparators, fig_comparators_density, fig_graft_regime, fig_plecta_control,
# fig_plecta_density, fig_plecta_gates, fig_plecta_performance,
# fig_plecta_sensitivity and fig_plecta_task, .pdf and .png each) were tracked
# before this rule landed, and .gitignore does not evict a tracked file. They
# stay tracked. Nothing else here enters the repository.
*
!.gitignore
